  "content": "# 第23题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n23. Students will be deregistered if ________.\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. they send emails in error\n\nB. B. they fail to work interactively\n\nC. C. they give their places to others\n\nD. D. they miss two sessions in a row\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nD\n\n",
  "answer": "D",
  "analysis": "本题考查定语从句。先行词是the factory，关系词在从句中作地点状语，故用where。A项which作主语或宾语；B项what不引导定语从句；C项that作主语或宾语。故选D。"
